Spec: Windows ConnectionMeter

Purpose:
  Track actual business bytes and completion using monotonic admission time.

Owns:
  ./ConnectionMeter.cs

References:
  ./LocalAccess.sdd
  /contracts/dotnet/LinkGate.Contracts/ConnectionStatus.sdd

Must:
  Keep state transitions, uint64 counters and snapshot sequence under one lock; businessPath requires actual positive bytes on the selected path.
  Require both FIN directions and drain before complete, preserve known counters on interrupted termination and fail closed on clock rollback or counter overflow.
  Keep immutable snapshots and recovered terminal records separate from retained open success.

Tasks:
  [x] #1 Verify state, persistence, replay, recovery and failure boundaries with owned local fixtures.
